## 4. DTOs and Bean Validation annotations

### Request DTO
File: `/home/daniel/sandbox/target/generated-sources/openapi/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/dto/OwnerFieldsDto.java`

Class-level (type) constraint (line 28): `@PostcodeValidation` (custom, cross-field city/postcode check).

Field/getter constraints:
- `firstName` (getter, line 79): `@NotNull @Pattern(regexp = "^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}$") @Size(min = 1, max = 30)`
- `lastName` (line 100): `@NotNull @Pattern(regexp = "^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}\\.?$") @Size(min = 1, max = 30)`
